@database ZZ9000-Drivers.guide
@$VER: ZZ9000-Drivers.guide 1.0 (29.9.2026)

@node Main "ZZ9000 Commodore Installer"
This is a Commodore Installer script drawer that end users run on an
AmigaOS system to install the ZZ9000's drivers, tools and config files.
It's bundled into every GitHub Release zip.

Contents

@{"Layout" link layout}

